<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <style>
        body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: #333; }
        .container { padding: 20px; max-width: 700px; margin: auto; }
        .header { font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .details-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 20px; }
        .details-table th, .details-table td { border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 8px; text-align: left; }
        .details-table th { background-color: #f2f2f2; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <p class="header">Group Booking Application - Ref: {{booking.groupRef}}</p>
        <p>Dear Saudia Group Booking Team,</p>
        <p>
            Please find a new group booking request submitted by one of our agents. 
            The official application letter is attached to this email.
        </p>

        <table class="details-table">
            <tr>
                <th colspan="2">Request Summary</th>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>Group Name</td>
                <td><strong>{{booking.groupName}}</strong></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>Total Passengers</td>
                <td><strong>{{booking.passengerCount}}</strong></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>Flight Number</td>
                <td><strong>{{booking.trip.flightNumber}}</strong></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>Route</td>
                <td><strong>{{booking.trip.originCode}} → {{booking.trip.destinationCode}}</strong></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>Departure Date</td>
                <td><strong>{{booking.travelDate}}</strong></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>Requesting Agent</td>
                <td><strong>{{agent.profile.firstName}} {{agent.profile.lastName}}</strong></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>Agent Contact</td>
                <td><strong>{{agent.user.email}}</strong></td>
            </tr>
        </table>

        <p style="margin-top: 20px;">
            We kindly request you to review the attached application and provide a quotation at your earliest convenience.
        </p>
        <p>
            <em>Please ensure the reference number <strong>{{booking.groupRef}}</strong> is included in the subject line of your reply for tracking purposes.</em>
        </p>
        <p>Thank you.</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>